WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.020
Enter room 402 and start continuous scanning.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:07.770
Check the possible doorway and the passage.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:12.480
After passing through the door, look for the room plate.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:21.830
The starting room plate reads 208. Look for a directory.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:30.830
The directory lists the destination on 4F. Look for a lift sign.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:38.520
The lift sign points right. Check the lift and travel to 4F.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:46.870
The landing sign reads 4F. Follow the corridor signs to 402.

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:55.430
The corridor sign points left toward room 402.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.280
Scan and verify the standalone 402 plate.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.255
The traveler confirms arrival and the camera stops.
